### Тестирование регистрации пользователя
### Используйте этот файл в VS Code с расширением REST Client или в IntelliJ IDEA

### 1. Успешная регистрация пользователя
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Abdufotihkhuja",
  "lastName": "Ravshankhujaev",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Qwer123$",
  "passwordConfirm": "Qwer123$"
}

###

### 2. Регистрация другого пользователя
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ivan",
  "lastName": "Ivanov",
  "email": "ivan.ivanov@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "passwordConfirm": "SecurePass123!"
}

###

### 3. Ошибка: пароли не совпадают
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Qwer123$",
  "passwordConfirm": "Different123$"
}

###

### 4. Ошибка: слабый пароль (нет заглавной буквы)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test2@example.com",
  "password": "qwer123$",
  "passwordConfirm": "qwer123$"
}

###

### 5. Ошибка: слабый пароль (нет спецсимвола)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "Qwer1234",
  "passwordConfirm": "Qwer1234"
}

###

### 6. Ошибка: слабый пароль (нет цифры)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test4@example.com",
  "password": "Qwerty$$$",
  "passwordConfirm": "Qwerty$$$"
}

###

### 7. Ошибка: пароль слишком короткий
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test5@example.com",
  "password": "Qw12$",
  "passwordConfirm": "Qw12$"
}

###

### 8. Ошибка: невалидный email
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "Qwer123$",
  "passwordConfirm": "Qwer123$"
}

###

### 9. Ошибка: дублирующийся email (если уже зарегистрирован)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Duplicate",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Qwer123$",
  "passwordConfirm": "Qwer123$"
}

###

### 10. Ошибка: отсутствует обязательное поле firstName
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test6@example.com",
  "password": "Qwer123$",
  "passwordConfirm": "Qwer123$"
}

###

### 11. Ошибка: отсутствует обязательное поле lastName
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "email": "test7@example.com",
  "password": "Qwer123$",
  "passwordConfirm": "Qwer123$"
}

###

### 12. Ошибка: отсутствует passwordConfirm
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test8@example.com",
  "password": "Qwer123$"
}

###

### 13. Ошибка: пустое firstName
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test9@example.com",
  "password": "Qwer123$",
  "passwordConfirm": "Qwer123$"
}

###

### 14. Ошибка: пустое lastName
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "",
  "email": "test10@example.com",
  "password": "Qwer123$",
